+    [local compat][E1] Hyphens are legal per the OpenAI function-name spec,
+    but siliconflow's Kimi-K2.7 endpoint silently fails to emit a structured
+    tool call for any declared name containing '-' (A/B verified 2026-08-26:
+    'mcp_github-downloader_git_clone' -> finish='stop' with zero tool_calls;
+    the same schema as 'mcp_github_downloader_git_clone' -> a correct call).
